            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Economic Policies</strong><br>\nHis economic policies focused on the public sector's growth, aiming for a mixed economy with the government controlling key industries.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Reforms in Society</strong><br>\nNehru sought to eradicate the caste system and improve women's status, introducing reforms to promote social justice and equality.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Legacy</strong><br>\nHis death marked the end of an era in Indian politics, and he is remembered for his contributions to shaping a modern, sovereign India.</p>\n"
              },
